  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project Humanitarian UXO clearance in Lao PDR, implemented by Halo Trust, aims to reduce the number of UXO related injuries and fatalities in Savannakhet province and increase the amount of safe land available to rural communities. The grant of &#x20ac;300,000 is projected under IDC 2023 Budget line: Outcome 2/Reducing vulnerabilities to reach the furthest behind.</narrative>
